SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Chiliomodi islet
LOCATION:Chiliomodi islet\, Patmos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the evening of 26 July caiques ferry people from Skala across to the uninhabited islet of Chiliomodi for the vespers at Agios Panteleimon\, then food\, wine and singing on the shore into the night. Ask at the Skala harbour that afternoon which boats are going and take a jumper.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#chiliomodi-islet-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-chiliomodi-is
